---
description: Static essay repo — where to edit and how to rebuild
alwaysApply: true
---

Before changing essay HTML, figures, or chapter CSS, read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) at the repo root.

- **Preview:** `full/index.html` (generated).
- **Edit:** `full/_sources/<chapter>.html`, then `python build_single_page.py` from repo root.
- **Do not** treat `full/index.html`, legacy `full/_legacy/*.html`, or `roadmap-timeline.js` as canonical for Fig. 10 — use `_sources/next-gen-chips.html`.
